dot_emacs Repository Version History
====================================

v26.07 (Release Date: TBD)
--------------------------
- Resolve the installer script directory before changing the working directory, so relative invocations work.
- Byte-compile with the elisp load path, so bundled files requiring the compatibility bridges are compiled.
- Allow nosudo installs and uninstalls to run when the sudo command is unavailable.
- Replace awk {n,} interval expression in usage() with a portable equivalent for mawk compatibility.
- Declare my-load-path with defvar in init.el before assigning it.
- Fix the dired-async loader so dired-async-mode is enabled at startup.
- Simplify the redundant timidity autoload wrapper in autoloads.el.
- Fix a typo blocking recentf-ext-settings.el from loading and clean up redundant/unused autoloads.el entries.
- Remove the unused auto-save-buffers block from autoloads.el, which could double up with auto-save-buffers-enhanced.
- Remove the obsolete default-major-mode setting, which no longer affects the major mode of new buffers.
- Add a quiet argument to load-p and use it for the optional site-lisp loader, which reported a failure on every startup.
- Stay quiet about the italk, mic-paren, and develock loaders, which are not bundled and failed on every startup.
- Disable the blinking cursor explicitly, since a nil argument now enables the mode instead of toggling it.
- Replace the obsolete find-file-hooks alias with find-file-hook in configs.el.
- Set temporary-file-directory to /dev/shm only on GNU/Linux, since platforms such as macOS have no such directory.
- Stop redefining the built-in previous-buffer, and bind M-n to a new forward-buffer command instead.
- Turn off hl-line in toggle-view-mode by calling hl-line-mode instead of assigning to its variable.
- Disable the malformed view-mode "." key entry, which signalled a commandp error instead of running a command.
- Require dired in dired-settings.el, which relied on another library to load dired-mode-map first.
- Apply the navi2ch proxy user and password only when the proxy is enabled.
- Fix with-suppressed-message so message-log-max is bound at run time instead of macro expansion time.
- Require cl-compat-bridge instead of the obsolete cl package in multi-term-settings.el.
- Restore legacy list accessors required while loading Rinari on Emacs 30.
- Guard set-face-bold-p calls in faces.el with fboundp to avoid breaking font-lock-mode-hook if the obsolete function is removed.
- Guard screen.el against an unset TERM environment variable to avoid a string-match error on startup.
- Drop the redundant .el suffix from the markdown-mode autoload-p call in lang-mode.el for consistency.
- Remove the bundled shadow.el and its settings, which collided with the built-in shadow.el and broke find-file.

v26.03 (2026-03-28)
-------------------
- Add IPAexGothic as explicit Japanese font for GNU/Linux and adjust default frame size.
- Switch default font from Bitstream Vera Sans Mono to DejaVu Sans Mono.
- Configure auto-save interval for auto-save-buffers-enhanced to stabilize background saving behavior.
- Simplify GUI platform settings and remove hard-coded Java paths.
- Adopt lexical-binding headers across all Emacs Lisp files.
- Normalize comments and indentation across Emacs Lisp configuration files.
- Expand Emacs Lisp design guidelines with long-term compatibility and maintenance policy.

v26.02 (2026-02-27)
-------------------
- Adjust Emacs transparency to 90/75 for better readability with minimal background interference.

v25.11 (2025-11-28)
-------------------
- Document long-term Emacs Lisp compatibility policy in doc/GUIDELINES.
- Adjust core-compat-bridge.el to use a correct with-eval-after-load fallback on old Emacs.
- Align cl-compat-bridge.el with 23.4..30.1 cl/cl-lib usage policy.
- Simplify ess-compat-bridge.el to alias old/new ESS variable names without overriding values.

v25.10 (2025-10-24)
-------------------
- Normalize chmod numeric modes to four digit octal across shell scripts.
- Standardize all shell scripts by removing trailing exit status lines (exit $?) for POSIX-safe reuse.
- Add C-c C-k key binding for clear-kill-ring in global-set-key.el.

v25.08.1 (2025-08-29)
---------------------
- Fix toggle-read-only compatibility in core-compat-bridge.el.

v25.08 (2025-08-20)
